  "id": "difference-threshold",
  "term": "difference threshold",
  "definition": "In historical psychophysics, the difference threshold is the point sought in measuring sense discrimination: the least difference between stimuli that is apprehended as different, expressed in contrast to an apparent equality. It belongs to the study of how differences in sensory experience are noticed.",
